  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Energy Policy Activity 2 (EPA 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to accelerate the sustainable development of the energy sector in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BIH). This will be achieved by enabling a smooth transition to clean energy and ensuring energy security for BiH.</narrative>
